{"id":"802de333bc401fce","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-resolution-completeness.md","title":"Resolution Completeness","display":"thm-resolution — Resolution Completeness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-resolution-completeness","aliases":["57-thm-resolution-completeness"],"display":"thm-resolution — Resolution Completeness","depends_on":["[[57-df-resolvent]]","[[57-df-clause-set]]","[[57-df-clause]]","[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-resolution-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-resolution-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-resolution — Resolution Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"164cfea6b6bdd968\" href=\"?note=164cfea6b6bdd968\" title=\"57-df-resolvent\">57-df-resolvent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1553e9a36bb0e6f9\" href=\"?note=1553e9a36bb0e6f9\" title=\"57-df-clause-set\">57-df-clause-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"963b86b5dc15d7e3\" href=\"?note=963b86b5dc15d7e3\" title=\"57-df-clause\">57-df-clause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Resolution-Completeness-Theorem\">Resolution Completeness Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\subseteq\\mathrm{Clause}_S\">\\(N\\subseteq\\mathrm{Clause}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\square=\\varnothing\">\\(\\square=\\varnothing\\)</span>，命题赋值语义取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"963b86b5dc15d7e3\" href=\"?note=963b86b5dc15d7e3\" title=\"57-df-clause\">57-df-clause</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Res}^*\">\\(\\mathrm{Res}^*\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"164cfea6b6bdd968\" href=\"?note=164cfea6b6bdd968\" title=\"57-df-resolvent\">57-df-resolvent</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\models_p\\square\">\\(N\\models_p\\square\\)</span> 按下式定义。最后一个等价式另要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in N\">\\(C\\in N\\)</span> 的文字原子都是闭的关系原子（无等号）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\models\\square\">\\(N\\models\\square\\)</span> 表示不存在同时满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 中所有子句的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N\\models_p\\square\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\exists v:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\forall C\\in N\\;(v\\models_p C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N\\models_p\\square\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\exists v:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\forall C\\in N\\;(v\\models_p C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N\\models_p\\square\\leftrightarrow\\square\\in\\mathrm{Res}^*(N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N\\models_p\\square\\leftrightarrow\\square\\in\\mathrm{Res}^*(N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N\\models\\square\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;\\forall C\\in N\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N\\models\\square\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;\\forall C\\in N\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N\\models\\square\\leftrightarrow\\square\\in\\mathrm{Res}^*(N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N\\models\\square\\leftrightarrow\\square\\in\\mathrm{Res}^*(N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原归结函数只删除字面互补文字，不执行一阶合一，因此一般一阶完备性不能直接断言；命题版本无此限制，结构语义版本明确限制为闭的无等号子句。去掉未参与公式的存在量化 π。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Resolution-Completeness-Theorem","text":"Resolution Completeness Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-resolvent","status":"resolved","id":"164cfea6b6bdd968","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-resolvent]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-clause-set","status":"resolved","id":"1553e9a36bb0e6f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-clause-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"963b86b5dc15d7e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-universe","status":"resolved","id":"d1505219185e27a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"963b86b5dc15d7e3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt"